OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits perverting justice over
OL,4,A2006 murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted perverting the
OL,7,Fcourse of justice in connection with
OL,8,Fthe murder of a 20-year-old in
OL,9,FSheffield two decades ago.
OL,11,FIbrahim Ilyas was shot dead as he sat
OL,12,Fin a car on Abbeyfield Road in the
OL,13,FPitsmoor area of the city on 3 June
OL,14,F2006, while two other men were injured
OL,15,Fduring the incident.
OL,17,FFaiser Hussain, 44, pleaded guilty to
OL,18,Fperverting the course of justice on
OL,19,FTuesday part-way through his trial at
OL,20,FHull Crown Court, where he had also
OL,21,Fbeen accused of one count of murder and
OL,22,Ftwo counts of attempted murder.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
